Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||12-28-2001||04:39 PM||||Sorry to hear that LZ... Strangley enough, the one time in my life when I gave up on finding "the one" -she just showed up one day!<P>I had been through many reckless relationships- getting hurt worse & worse each time.  When I met "her" it was like all the other bad stuff just went away! I was able to open up to her more than I ever could've to anyone else... no reason other than it was "just easy."<P>Hang in there... and you'll get through it. Hope you have at least one great friend to hang on to in the mean time- I know that's what got me through!<P>And what was said about utilizing a friend's GF and her friends... is a good place to start.  And remember- don't go into any relationship expecting anything more than a friendship... and be pleasantly surprised when something better comes of it.  Just don't give up!||||reg||1
