Z||000019||filthyscarecrow||12-29-2001||08:14 PM||||hmm. i think it's because women seem to think that if they can attain something easily, it's not worth it. they want what they can't have, not what they can. <BR>i was kinda seeing this girl back home and things were going well. we both really liked each other, and then i made the mistake of telling her that i liked her. bam! no communication for a week, and then she sends me an email saying "well, i guess i dno't have the same feelings for you that i thought i did." <BR>one thing i have noticed is that girls usually come to grips with reality when they get out of their teens and that whole ken doll fantasy is over with. don't get me wrong, there are still psychos out there, but for the most part, they are much easier to deal with. try to stay away from girls that seem to always have a boyfriend though. most of them have no idea who they are, but they have a pretty good idea of who you ought to be. ||||reg||1
